text I felt as if time has stopped.
text "Do you... like me...?"
text It is a simple question.
text As we are dating each other, you may even say this is a ridiculous question to ask.
text If we are lovers, then there is a simple answer to this question.
text And yet...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text Why can't I give her an answer...?
text The words "I like you" just won't come out of my throat.
text My own feelings begin to dawn on me.
text Yesterday... I was shocked when Kyou saw Ryou and I kissing...
text And the heart-piercing pain I can feel in my chest...
text I look at Ryou's face...
text And I see a different face instead.
text The obnoxious pressure inside my chest...
text ...As well as my wavering feelings are holding me back from saying those words.
