text @[Ryou]
text Tomoya-kun...
text That reminds me...
text I haven't yet told Ryou that I like her...
text Even though we are dating...
text I haven't once told her how I myself feel.
text But...
text How do I actually feel...?
text The inside of my mouth begins to dry up.
text My tongue is glued to the roof of my mouth, and although my lips are moving, words do not come out.
text The unpleasant silence continues.
text Even my throat begins to dry up, as if it is refusing to give voice to any words.
text Given the atmosphere, it feels as if I am even hesitating to sigh.
text I can't look her straight in the eye.
